	(text "SX1262 + PE4259 switch (as Semtech's own reference designs). Topology from Semtech E428V03A (AN1200.40 Fig 5);\nTBD values = that design's 915 MHz BOM. PE4259 single-pin mode: VDD = LR_VIO, CTRL = DIO2 via 1k;\nCTRL high = RFC-RF1 = TX (RF1 pin 1), low = RFC-RF2 = RX (RF2 pin 3). P1dB 29.5 dBm min at VDD 1.8 V.\nVBAT_IO = LR_VIO (nPM1300 LOADSW1). FW: hold LR_NRESET low and SPI/NSS low or hi-Z until LR_VIO is on, then reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
